----------------+-----------------
 TECHCORP       | 
 TECHCORP       | Headphones
 TECHCORP       | Keyboard
                | USB Cable
 TECHCORP       | WIRELESS ROUTER
 TECHCORP       | Wireless Mouse
                | tablet
                | 
 FASTPARTS      | 
(9 rows)

SET paradedb.enable_join_custom_scan = off;
